{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:03b282a19442577f","name":"The Mask of Darth Nihilus (Sith Artifact)","source":{"id":"source:reference-03b282a19442577f","title":"The Mask of Darth Nihilus (Sith Artifact)","revision":23489,"timestamp":"2024-09-29T12:53:41Z","sha256":"14fda0186bb3fb5743efb80e05d2218266b7756f6e427e2f297f62187aa622c4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=23489","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Mask%20of%20Darth%20Nihilus%20%28Sith%20Artifact%29&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-03b282a19442577f","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This Sith artifact encourages the wearer to slowly destroy him- or herself for greater power. Anyone who does not possess Force-related ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"}," gains ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Sensitivity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Sensitivity","referenceId":"reference:5202cab02f367bcf"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Training"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Training","referenceId":"reference:24f2c1df8e62fd15"}," while wearing the mask. A Jedi or Sith wearing the mask gains two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Training"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Training","referenceId":"reference:24f2c1df8e62fd15"}," feats. At least half of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"}," gained in this manner must have the [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side"}]},"] descriptor.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The mask extracts a heavy toll from its wearer. Each time the wearer uses a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," or spends a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"},", he or she gains a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Point"},". Each time the wearer uses a number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"}," equal to his or her ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," modifier in a single encounter, the wearer moves -1 step on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," and gains a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent Condition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent_Condition"},". The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent Condition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent_Condition"}," is removed only when the wearer takes off the mask.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
